{"3695260": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Wrong Way", "steam_appid": 3695260, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a <strong>weaver</strong>. When residents can't find the way around their ever-changing Town, they call you!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695260/extras/93a3411e8e25c93e1a8f79ccb0b6d966.avif?t=1788211701\" width=1560 height=585 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rotate the tiles to create a path for one person…<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695260/extras/75147a44541d4a4ea297322660aa0484.poster.avif?t=1788211701\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695260/extras/75147a44541d4a4ea297322660aa0484.webm?t=1788211701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695260/extras/75147a44541d4a4ea297322660aa0484.mp4?t=1788211701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>…without blocking the path of another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695260/extras/7d4c41c119afc5ad940868ea7b31a089.poster.avif?t=1788211701\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695260/extras/7d4c41c119afc5ad940868ea7b31a089.webm?t=1788211701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695260/extras/7d4c41c119afc5ad940868ea7b31a089.mp4?t=1788211701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The job will become more difficult over time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One person won't go past orange cats, the other won't go further than ten tiles. Help those who are unsure of their final destination: carefully inspect the area and find a spot, which fulfills their needs.<br><br>Get familiar with people living in Town: learn about their quirks, relationships and stories. Help them change the Town for the better.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695260/extras/65e064f455e3deff3e0e529b0a212d6e.avif?t=1788211701\" width=1560 height=802 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover all the secrets of this cozy town!<br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695260/extras/4c5ed4e62500a510d4cd1477082ccfd4.poster.avif?t=1788211701\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695260/extras/4c5ed4e62500a510d4cd1477082ccfd4.webm?t=1788211701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695260/extras/4c5ed4e62500a510d4cd1477082ccfd4.mp4?t=1788211701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >***</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >We are offering you a job in our town!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You get:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge</strong>. A job isn't easy but it's rewarding. 8 districts, 40+ levels for you to work through;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>story </strong>that changes with your actions. 3 endings. Personal stories of many citizens, which can not only be observed, but also influenced by your decisions;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>community</strong> with its own personality. Help more then 20  characters find their way;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mystery</strong>. Why does the Town look this way? How does it function? Unlock hidden levels to uncover more secrets about the Town’s history.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>chance </strong>to build something new: DLC with your own tools for city making*</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*DLC release depends on sales of the main game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695260/extras/9b5f63f8b1063e7b33c757abc2c30f78.poster.avif?t=1788211701\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695260/extras/9b5f63f8b1063e7b33c757abc2c30f78.webm?t=1788211701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695260/extras/9b5f63f8b1063e7b33c757abc2c30f78.mp4?t=1788211701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a <strong>weaver</strong>. When residents can't find the way around their ever-changing Town, they call you!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695260/extras/93a3411e8e25c93e1a8f79ccb0b6d966.avif?t=1788211701\" width=1560 height=585 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rotate the tiles to create a path for one person…<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695260/extras/75147a44541d4a4ea297322660aa0484.poster.avif?t=1788211701\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695260/extras/75147a44541d4a4ea297322660aa0484.webm?t=1788211701\" ty